invariant: INV-48
file: src/mldsa_avx2.c
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mldsa-avx2
reason: the four-way sampler reads every entry's blocks from state 0, so
  the entries after the first of each call are the first one's. Only an
  x86-64 compiler reads the line, so the script builds
  bin/mldsa_avx2_equiv_test for x86-64 and runs it under qemu-x86_64. The
  lane skips without docker, and this then reports unguarded rather than
  caught.

--- old
            keccak_avx2_block(block, state, k);
--- new
            keccak_avx2_block(block, state, 0);
